(resource)  validator: These attributes cannot be configured together: [config.allowed_topics,config.competition,config.custom_evaluation,config.hallucination_completeness,config.hallucination_context_adherence,config.hallucination_context_relevance,config.hallucination_correctness,config.hallucination_task_adherence,config.language_mismatch,config.pii,config.prompt_injection,config.restricted_topics,config.sexism,config.sql_allowed_tables,config.sql_hallucination,config.sql_load,config.sql_read_only,config.sql_restricted_tables,config.toxicity]
application  StringAttribute required
    plan modifier: If the value of this attribute changes, Terraform will destroy and recreate the resource.
    validator: string length must be between 1 and 256
company_id  StringAttribute computed
config  SingleNestedAttribute required
config.allowed_topics  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.allowed_topics.topics  SetAttribute optional elem=basetypes.StringType
    validator: element value must satisfy all validations: string length must be between 1 and 256
    validator: set must contain at least 1 elements
    validator: set must contain at most 1024 elements
config.competition  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.competition.competitors  SetAttribute optional elem=basetypes.StringType
    validator: element value must satisfy all validations: string length must be between 1 and 256
    validator: set must contain at least 1 elements
    validator: set must contain at most 1024 elements
config.custom_evaluation  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.custom_evaluation.examples  ListNestedAttribute optional
    validator: list must contain at most 100 elements
config.custom_evaluation.examples[].conversation  StringAttribute optional
    validator: string length must be between 0 and 65536
config.custom_evaluation.examples[].score  Int64Attribute optional
    validator: value must be at least 0
config.custom_evaluation.instructions  StringAttribute optional
    validator: string length must be between 1 and 1048576
config.custom_evaluation.policy_type  StringAttribute optional
    validator: string length must be between 1 and 256
config.custom_evaluation.safe  StringAttribute optional
    validator: string length must be between 0 and 65536
config.custom_evaluation.should_include_system_prompt  BoolAttribute optional
config.custom_evaluation.violates  StringAttribute optional
    validator: string length must be between 0 and 65536
config.hallucination_completeness  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.hallucination_context_adherence  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.hallucination_context_relevance  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.hallucination_correctness  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.hallucination_task_adherence  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.language_mismatch  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.pii  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.pii.categories  SetAttribute optional elem=basetypes.StringType
    validator: element value must satisfy all validations: value must be one of: ["CREDIT_CARD" "EMAIL_ADDRESS" "IBAN_CODE" "PHONE_NUMBER" "US_SSN"]
    validator: set must contain at least 1 elements
    validator: set must contain at most 1024 elements
config.prompt_injection  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.prompt_injection.additional_context  StringAttribute optional
    validator: string length must be between 0 and 65536
config.restricted_topics  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.restricted_topics.topics  SetAttribute optional elem=basetypes.StringType
    validator: element value must satisfy all validations: string length must be between 1 and 256
    validator: set must contain at least 1 elements
    validator: set must contain at most 1024 elements
config.sexism  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.sql_allowed_tables  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.sql_allowed_tables.tables  SetAttribute optional elem=basetypes.StringType
    validator: element value must satisfy all validations: string length must be between 1 and 256
    validator: set must contain at least 1 elements
    validator: set must contain at most 1024 elements
config.sql_hallucination  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.sql_load  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.sql_load.allow_recursive_cte  BoolAttribute optional
config.sql_load.cte_limit  Int64Attribute optional
    validator: value must be at least 0
config.sql_load.join_limit  Int64Attribute optional
    validator: value must be at least 0
config.sql_read_only  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.sql_restricted_tables  SingleNestedAttribute optional
config.sql_restricted_tables.tables  SetAttribute optional elem=basetypes.StringType
    validator: element value must satisfy all validations: string length must be between 1 and 256
    validator: set must contain at least 1 elements
    validator: set must contain at most 1024 elements
config.toxicity  SingleNestedAttribute optional
created_at  StringAttribute computed
created_by  StringAttribute computed
id  StringAttribute computed
    plan modifier: Once set, the value of this attribute in state will not change.
is_enabled  BoolAttribute optional computed
    default: value defaults to false
subsystem  StringAttribute required
    plan modifier: If the value of this attribute changes, Terraform will destroy and recreate the resource.
    validator: string length must be between 1 and 256
target  StringAttribute optional
    plan modifier: If the value of this attribute changes, Terraform will destroy and recreate the resource.
    validator: value must be one of: ["CONVERSATION" "PROMPT" "RESPONSE"]
threshold  Float64Attribute optional
    validator: value must be between 0.000000 and 1.000000
updated_at  StringAttribute computed
